<title>USA: Maritrans to buy Sun ships.</title>
<headline>Maritrans to buy Sun ships.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maritrans Inc said on Friday it agreed to buy the remaining assets of Sun Co Inc's Sun Transport for $30 million.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Maritrans said it will buy six vessels.</p>
<p>The acquisitions are expected to improve the company's net income and cash flow in the short and long term and will increase contracted revenue, Maritrans said in a statement.</p>
</text>
